{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日（11月19日）盛大舉行！每年台慶最備受網民及傳媒矚目的環節，絕對是一眾花旦女星在紅地氈上的爭妍鬥麗。今年全台女藝員再次傾巢而出，以最吸睛、最性感的晚裝造型亮相紅毯。本文將為你緊貼直擊《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈盛況，一網打盡各大視后大熱、一線花旦及新生代小花的絕美打扮！邊個最性感搶鏡？邊個衣著大出事？即睇全場最靚女星造型圖輯及高清相片！</p><figure><img alt=\"王敏慈。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200132530318086144158643.jpeg/-PZ_Lk30hHZV_ylOMXTxfbUwtnySmMktoIjq8ZaI6vE\"/><figcaption>王敏慈。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200131716468183040905428.jpeg/UmvvCXlbHpEi2bGKX4YnAGz83QIAPvJPTx6PcHkej3A\"/><figcaption>何沛珈。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200131713322323968207683.jpeg/6cKxuIBus4WLBkut4KOBL8RpcTMUYUtFjwaUm7kGlJs\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龔嘉欣。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200131710029664256705269.jpeg/ufwsoDODDuTVLY3T10DR8M2OzFu4MxGO7Tr6SNs6-kg\"/><figcaption>龔嘉欣。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林凱恩。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200132015131725824624038.jpeg/QvyAz9UbUiuVbkFPAYqr3K2HWRuhiN5hJSMjphMjI6Y\"/><figcaption>林凱恩。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"倪樂琳。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200132597636665344581974.jpeg/_k1B2iL92WTZOCBOUCXl6PnGXLe98u2NZ_2VbFH9lWw\"/><figcaption>倪樂琳。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"倪樂琳側面超澎湃。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200132769401802752827435.jpeg/WYwDXU4-jf5ltlVJ55jiGS9eMHw6TA9eyWXRFv9l0RY\"/><figcaption>倪樂琳側面超澎湃。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.283573+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:05:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:20.111403+00:00","content_update